"Ben is a man from Earth whose soul woke in the body of the dead village boy Benjamin."
"On Earth Ben was a computer science student with parents and a little sister he lost."
"Ben's body woke unharmed outside his burning village; the fire came with huge mana spikes."
"At Ben's first advancement the system hit a threshold error and requested higher authority."
"When Ben reached the Door within himself, it was already wide open."
"After advancing, Ben's irises briefly turned silver; he feels he forgot something at the Door."
"Ben dreams of the open Door in a dark void, with chains rattling beyond it."
"Ben's cycling technique is Central Plains military property, taught him by Duncan."
"Ben lies that a misfired escape scroll carried him west; a spatial portal took him through the wall."
"Ben believes he has a kinetic affinity and wants to recreate the feeling of his Trance."
